{
  "_type": "export",
  "__export_format": 4,
  "__export_date": "2026-09-02T00:00:00.000Z",
  "__export_source": "insomnia.manual:ecommerce-vuelos",
  "resources": [
    {
      "_id": "wrk_ecommerce_vuelos",
      "_type": "workspace",
      "name": "Ecommerce Vuelos API",
      "description": "Coleccion para probar la API de pasajes de avion. Autenticacion JWT (Authorization: Bearer <token>). Los folders estan numerados en el orden pensado para correrlos de punta a punta: Auth -> Aerolineas -> Vuelos -> Carrito -> Ordenes. Los requests de login y de creacion (aerolinea/vuelo/item/checkout) tienen un script 'after-response' que guarda automaticamente el token/id devuelto en las variables de entorno (token_admin, token_pasajero, aerolinea_id, vuelo_id, item_id, orden_id). Si tu version de Insomnia no ejecuta esos scripts, copia el valor manualmente desde la respuesta a Manage Environments.",
      "scope": "collection"
    },
    {
      "_id": "env_base",
      "_type": "environment",
      "parentId": "wrk_ecommerce_vuelos",
      "name": "Base Environment",
      "data": {
        "base_url": "http://localhost:8080",
        "token_admin": "",
        "token_pasajero": "",
        "aerolinea_id": "",
        "vuelo_id": "",
        "item_id": "",
        "orden_id": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "fld_auth",
      "_type": "request_group",
      "parentId": "wrk_ecommerce_vuelos",
      "name": "1. Auth"
    },
    {
      "_id": "fld_aerolineas",
      "_type": "request_group",
      "parentId": "wrk_ecommerce_vuelos",
      "name": "2. Aerolineas (Admin)"
    },
    {
      "_id": "fld_vuelos",
      "_type": "request_group",
      "parentId": "wrk_ecommerce_vuelos",
      "name": "3. Vuelos"
    },
    {
      "_id": "fld_carrito",
      "_type": "request_group",
      "parentId": "wrk_ecommerce_vuelos",
      "name": "4. Carrito (Pasajero)"
    },
    {
      "_id": "fld_ordenes",
      "_type": "request_group",
      "parentId": "wrk_ecommerce_vuelos",
      "name": "5. Ordenes (Pasajero)"
    },
    {
      "_id": "fld_errores",
      "_type": "request_group",
      "parentId": "wrk_ecommerce_vuelos",
      "name": "6. Casos de error (bonus)"
    },
    {
      "_id": "fld_cleanup",
      "_type": "request_group",
      "parentId": "wrk_ecommerce_vuelos",
      "name": "7. Cleanup (opcional, no correr en medio del flujo)"
    },

    {
      "_id": "req_registro_pasajero",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_auth",
      "name": "1. Registro pasajero",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/auth/registro/pasajero",
      "body": {
        "mimeType": "application/json",
        "text": "{\n  \"username\": \"mile\",\n  \"mail\": \"mile@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\",\n  \"nombre\": \"Milena\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Giudice\"\n}"
      },
      "headers": [{ "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
      "description": "Publico. Si ya corriste la coleccion antes, este usuario ya existe y da 400 (username duplicado) - es esperado, segui con el login."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_login_pasajero",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_auth",
      "name": "2. Login pasajero",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/auth/login",
      "body": {
        "mimeType": "application/json",
        "text": "{\n  \"username\": \"mile\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\"\n}"
      },
      "headers": [{ "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
      "afterResponseScript": "const body = insomnia.response.json();\ninsomnia.environment.set('token_pasajero', body.token);",
      "description": "Publico. Devuelve { token, usuario }. El script guarda el token en la variable de entorno token_pasajero. Si no se auto-completa, copialo manualmente."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_login_admin",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_auth",
      "name": "3. Login admin",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/auth/login",
      "body": {
        "mimeType": "application/json",
        "text": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
      },
      "headers": [{ "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
      "afterResponseScript": "const body = insomnia.response.json();\ninsomnia.environment.set('token_admin', body.token);",
      "description": "Publico. Usa el admin semilla creado por DataSeeder. Guarda el token en token_admin."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_me",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_auth",
      "name": "4. Me (usuario logueado)",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/auth/me",
      "headers": [{ "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ _.token_pasajero }}" }],
      "description": "Requiere token. Devuelve los datos del usuario dueno del token."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_registro_admin",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_auth",
      "name": "5. Registro administrador (requiere admin)",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/auth/registro/administrador",
      "body": {
        "mimeType": "application/json",
        "text": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin2\",\n  \"mail\": \"admin2@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\",\n  \"nombre\": \"Ana\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Admin\",\n  \"permisos\": [\"GESTION_VUELOS\"]\n}"
      },
      "headers": [
        { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
        { "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ _.token_admin }}" }
      ],
      "description": "Requiere token de un ADMINISTRADOR. Corre 3. Login admin antes."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_logout",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_auth",
      "name": "6. Logout",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/auth/logout",
      "headers": [{ "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ _.token_pasajero }}" }],
      "description": "Con JWT stateless el logout es logico: solo confirma 204, el token en si sigue siendo valido hasta que expira (24hs). El 'cierre de sesion' real es que el cliente descarte el token."
    },

    {
      "_id": "req_aerolineas_listar",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_aerolineas",
      "name": "1. Listar aerolineas",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/aerolineas",
      "description": "Publico."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_aerolineas_crear",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_aerolineas",
      "name": "2. Crear aerolinea (ADMIN)",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/aerolineas",
      "body": {
        "mimeType": "application/json",
        "text": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Aerolineas Demo API\"\n}"
      },
      "headers": [
        { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
        { "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ _.token_admin }}" }
      ],
      "afterResponseScript": "const body = insomnia.response.json();\ninsomnia.environment.set('aerolinea_id', String(body.id));",
      "description": "Requiere token de ADMINISTRADOR. Guarda el id creado en aerolinea_id."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_aerolineas_obtener",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_aerolineas",
      "name": "3. Obtener aerolinea por id",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/aerolineas/{{ _.aerolinea_id }}",
      "description": "Publico."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_aerolineas_actualizar",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_aerolineas",
      "name": "4. Actualizar aerolinea (ADMIN)",
      "method": "PUT",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/aerolineas/{{ _.aerolinea_id }}",
      "body": {
        "mimeType": "application/json",
        "text": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Aerolineas Demo API Actualizada\"\n}"
      },
      "headers": [
        { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
        { "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ _.token_admin }}" }
      ],
      "description": "Requiere token de ADMINISTRADOR."
    },

    {
      "_id": "req_vuelos_crear",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_vuelos",
      "name": "1. Crear vuelo (ADMIN)",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/vuelos",
      "body": {
        "mimeType": "application/json",
        "text": "{\n  \"origen\": \"Buenos Aires\",\n  \"destino\": \"Madrid\",\n  \"fechaSalida\": \"2026-12-15T10:00:00\",\n  \"precio\": 500.00,\n  \"asientosDisponibles\": 100,\n  \"descuento\": 0,\n  \"clase\": \"ECONOMICA\",\n  \"aerolineaId\": {{ _.aerolinea_id }}\n}"
      },
      "headers": [
        { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
        { "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ _.token_admin }}" }
      ],
      "afterResponseScript": "const body = insomnia.response.json();\ninsomnia.environment.set('vuelo_id', String(body.id));",
      "description": "Requiere token de ADMINISTRADOR y aerolinea_id (correr antes 2. Crear aerolinea). Guarda el id creado en vuelo_id. Valores de clase: ECONOMICA, EJECUTIVA, PRIMERA."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_vuelos_buscar",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_vuelos",
      "name": "2. Buscar vuelos",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/vuelos",
      "parameters": [
        { "name": "origen", "value": "Buenos Aires", "disabled": true },
        { "name": "destino", "value": "Madrid", "disabled": true },
        { "name": "clase", "value": "ECONOMICA", "disabled": true },
        { "name": "precioMin", "value": "100", "disabled": true },
        { "name": "precioMax", "value": "1000", "disabled": true }
      ],
      "description": "Publico. Todos los query params son opcionales (activalos segun necesites)."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_vuelos_obtener",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_vuelos",
      "name": "3. Obtener vuelo por id",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/vuelos/{{ _.vuelo_id }}",
      "description": "Publico."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_vuelos_actualizar",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_vuelos",
      "name": "4. Actualizar vuelo (ADMIN)",
      "method": "PUT",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/vuelos/{{ _.vuelo_id }}",
      "body": {
        "mimeType": "application/json",
        "text": "{\n  \"origen\": \"Buenos Aires\",\n  \"destino\": \"Madrid\",\n  \"fechaSalida\": \"2026-12-15T10:00:00\",\n  \"precio\": 550.00,\n  \"asientosDisponibles\": 90,\n  \"descuento\": 5,\n  \"clase\": \"ECONOMICA\",\n  \"aerolineaId\": {{ _.aerolinea_id }}\n}"
      },
      "headers": [
        { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
        { "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ _.token_admin }}" }
      ],
      "description": "Requiere token de ADMINISTRADOR."
    },

    {
      "_id": "req_carrito_obtener",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_carrito",
      "name": "1. Obtener carrito",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/carrito",
      "headers": [{ "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ _.token_pasajero }}" }],
      "description": "Requiere token de PASAJERO."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_carrito_agregar_item",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_carrito",
      "name": "2. Agregar item al carrito",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/carrito/items",
      "body": {
        "mimeType": "application/json",
        "text": "{\n  \"vueloId\": {{ _.vuelo_id }},\n  \"cantidad\": 2\n}"
      },
      "headers": [
        { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
        { "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ _.token_pasajero }}" }
      ],
      "afterResponseScript": "const body = insomnia.response.json();\nconst items = body.items;\ninsomnia.environment.set('item_id', String(items[items.length - 1].id));",
      "description": "Requiere token de PASAJERO y vuelo_id (correr antes 1. Crear vuelo). Guarda el id del item agregado en item_id."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_carrito_actualizar_item",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_carrito",
      "name": "3. Actualizar cantidad de item",
      "method": "PUT",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/carrito/items/{{ _.item_id }}",
      "body": {
        "mimeType": "application/json",
        "text": "{\n  \"cantidad\": 3\n}"
      },
      "headers": [
        { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
        { "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ _.token_pasajero }}" }
      ],
      "description": "Requiere token de PASAJERO."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_carrito_eliminar_item",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_carrito",
      "name": "4. Eliminar item del carrito (demo)",
      "method": "DELETE",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/carrito/items/{{ _.item_id }}",
      "headers": [{ "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ _.token_pasajero }}" }],
      "description": "Requiere token de PASAJERO. Solo para mostrar el endpoint de borrado: deja el carrito vacio, por eso el siguiente paso vuelve a agregar un item antes del checkout."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_carrito_agregar_item_para_checkout",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_carrito",
      "name": "5. Agregar item de nuevo (para checkout)",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/carrito/items",
      "body": {
        "mimeType": "application/json",
        "text": "{\n  \"vueloId\": {{ _.vuelo_id }},\n  \"cantidad\": 1\n}"
      },
      "headers": [
        { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
        { "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ _.token_pasajero }}" }
      ],
      "afterResponseScript": "const body = insomnia.response.json();\nconst items = body.items;\ninsomnia.environment.set('item_id', String(items[items.length - 1].id));",
      "description": "Requiere token de PASAJERO y vuelo_id."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_carrito_checkout",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_carrito",
      "name": "6. Checkout",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/carrito/checkout",
      "headers": [{ "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ _.token_pasajero }}" }],
      "afterResponseScript": "const body = insomnia.response.json();\ninsomnia.environment.set('orden_id', String(body.id));",
      "description": "Requiere token de PASAJERO y un carrito con items. Genera la orden y guarda su id en orden_id."
    },

    {
      "_id": "req_ordenes_historial",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_ordenes",
      "name": "1. Historial de ordenes",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/ordenes",
      "headers": [{ "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ _.token_pasajero }}" }],
      "description": "Requiere token de PASAJERO."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_ordenes_obtener",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_ordenes",
      "name": "2. Obtener orden por id",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/ordenes/{{ _.orden_id }}",
      "headers": [{ "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ _.token_pasajero }}" }],
      "description": "Requiere token de PASAJERO. Solo el dueno de la orden puede verla."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_ordenes_cancelar",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_ordenes",
      "name": "3. Cancelar orden",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/ordenes/{{ _.orden_id }}/cancelar",
      "headers": [{ "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ _.token_pasajero }}" }],
      "description": "Requiere token de PASAJERO. Devuelve la orden con asientos liberados."
    },

    {
      "_id": "req_error_sin_token",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_errores",
      "name": "Endpoint protegido sin token -> 401",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/carrito",
      "description": "Sin header Authorization. Debe devolver 401 'No autenticado'."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_error_rol_incorrecto",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_errores",
      "name": "Crear vuelo con rol PASAJERO -> 403",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/vuelos",
      "body": {
        "mimeType": "application/json",
        "text": "{\n  \"origen\": \"Buenos Aires\",\n  \"destino\": \"Roma\",\n  \"fechaSalida\": \"2026-12-15T10:00:00\",\n  \"precio\": 800.00,\n  \"asientosDisponibles\": 50,\n  \"descuento\": 0,\n  \"clase\": \"ECONOMICA\",\n  \"aerolineaId\": {{ _.aerolinea_id }}\n}"
      },
      "headers": [
        { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
        { "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ _.token_pasajero }}" }
      ],
      "description": "Token valido pero sin rol ADMINISTRADOR. Debe devolver 403 'No tiene permisos para realizar esta accion'."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_error_credenciales_invalidas",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_errores",
      "name": "Login con credenciales invalidas -> 401",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/auth/login",
      "body": {
        "mimeType": "application/json",
        "text": "{\n  \"username\": \"noexiste\",\n  \"password\": \"loquesea\"\n}"
      },
      "headers": [{ "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
      "description": "Debe devolver 401 'Usuario o contraseña incorrectos'."
    },

    {
      "_id": "req_vuelos_eliminar",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_cleanup",
      "name": "Eliminar vuelo (ADMIN)",
      "method": "DELETE",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/vuelos/{{ _.vuelo_id }}",
      "headers": [{ "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ _.token_admin }}" }],
      "description": "Correr al final, despues de terminar el flujo de Carrito/Ordenes (si borras el vuelo antes, esos pasos van a fallar). Si el vuelo tiene una orden asociada (como en este flujo, salvo que la hayas cancelado antes) devuelve 400 'No se puede eliminar un vuelo con ordenes asociadas'."
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_aerolineas_eliminar",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_cleanup",
      "name": "Eliminar aerolinea (ADMIN)",
      "method": "DELETE",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/aerolineas/{{ _.aerolinea_id }}",
      "headers": [{ "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ _.token_admin }}" }],
      "description": "Correr despues de eliminar el vuelo (una aerolinea con vuelos asociados no deberia poder borrarse)."
    }
  ]
}
